# S0c (REFERENCE): the eight-seat 262k attach and the exactness smoke on the CONTROL profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-4e-control-audit (the audited production profile; the read-only memory
# ledger it names is already on in the image, so at run time it IS the audited production profile): the reference S0 is read against. READ: admission passed at capacity 262144, reservation
# installed with num_gpu_blocks=19968, every answer completes, c2_smoke_check clean, no stall, ZERO audit mismatches. RECORD per request the answer hash, the accepted tokens and the verify rounds
# (concurrent8_code_equal, concurrent8_steady, concurrent8_code_32k), the memory ledger's P6 'packed_block' reading for block1 and block2 (they must be equal within a few MB) and the ledger's free
# DRAM per chip at eight live seats. Duration (estimate): 40 min. Stop rule: a failure ends THIS pack (Z still runs).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the exact-GDN-memory pack (tp4/gdn-shared-history; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry:
# the cards are resolved at run time. ORDER.txt has the order, stop rules, minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1 stands for
# the combined window's one image (the integration step replaces it in every template of every pack); a commit of a file the image carries needs a new build and a new tag.
# The cards are under development: no agentstop, agentstart or hand-back job exists in this pack. The profiles are GATE ONLY: nothing here serves traffic.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-4e-control-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_equal
